OL,3,AOpenAI CEO Sam Altman says 'right to be
OL,4,Aafraid of AI' - but 'world should
OL,5,Atrust' tech firms
OL,6,
OL,7,FOpenAI CEO Sam Altman says it is right
OL,8,Fto be afraid of AI - but "the world
OL,9,Fshould trust we are going to do the
OL,10,Fright thing"
OL,12,FAltman says it's important to learn
OL,13,Ffrom AI "accidents" - just as the
OL,14,Faviation industry does
OL,16,FHe's one of several AI bosses speaking
OL,17,Fat a California conference where Nvidia
OL,18,Fboss Jensen Huang says there's no need
OL,19,Ffor new laws - instead AI companies
OL,20,Fshould "simply not release anything
OL,21,Fthat they are not confident will be
OL,22,Fsafe"
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
