OL,3,AOpenAI CEO Sam Altman says 'right to be
OL,4,Aafraid of AI' - but 'world should
OL,5,Atrust' tech firms
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthropic's boss says it is tempting to
OL,8,F"attack" competitors but it is more
OL,9,Fresponsible to try to establish
OL,10,Findustry-wide standards
OL,12,FMeanwhile, Senator Bernie Sanders calls
OL,13,Fon the US to work with China on AI
OL,14,Fregulation, while ex-Trump adviser
OL,15,FSteve Bannon calls AI the "defining
OL,16,Fissue of our time" - their appearance
OL,17,Fis a rare show of bipartisanship,
OL,18,Fwrites our Washington correspondent
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
