OL,3,AOpenAI CEO Sam Altman says 'right to be
OL,4,Aafraid of AI' - but 'world should
OL,5,Atrust' tech firms
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after an Anthropic executive
OL,8,Ftold the BBC that AI is getting more
OL,9,Fpowerful "by the day" and a kill switch
OL,10,Fshould be mandatory
OL,12,FEarlier this week, Donald Trump
OL,13,Fdownplayed AI concerns, saying claims
OL,14,Fit will take over the world are a
OL,15,F"hoax"
